    {
      "source": "Simple holder for a decoding <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> and an encoding\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiConsumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiConsumer</code></a> to use with Reactor Netty.",
      "translation": "用于解码 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> 和编码 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiConsumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiConsumer</code></a> 的简单包装器，以便与 Reactor Netty 配合使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convenient base class for <a href=\"ReactorNettyCodec.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.tcp.reactor\"><code>ReactorNettyCodec</code></a> implementations that need\nto work with NIO <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "适用于需要与 NIO <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffers</code></a> 一起使用的 <a href=\"ReactorNettyCodec.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.tcp.reactor\"><code>ReactorNettyCodec</code></a> 实现的便捷基类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Contract to encode and decode a <a href=\"../../Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a> to and from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a>\nallowing a higher-level protocol (for example, STOMP over TCP) to plug in.",
      "translation": "用于将 `<a href=\"../../Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a>` 编码和解码为及从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>ByteBuffer</code></a>`，从而允许更高级别的协议（例如 TCP 上的 STOMP）进行插接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Generic support for simple messaging protocols (like STOMP).",
      "translation": "支持简单消息协议（如 STOMP）的通用功能。",
      "count": 1
